WEBVTT

00:20.350 --> 00:24.390
♪ As flowers bloom and wither ♪

00:24.390 --> 00:30.090
♪ May we pass by the magnificent scenery ♪

00:30.980 --> 00:35.140
♪ Contemplate the vastness
of Heaven and Earth ♪

00:35.140 --> 00:40.910
♪ Could it be that both of us
are filled with desolation? ♪

00:41.790 --> 00:45.630
♪ As flowers bloom and wither ♪

00:45.630 --> 00:51.400
♪ May we lead such a life ♪

00:52.350 --> 00:56.520
♪ Contemplate the vastness
of Heaven and Earth ♪

00:56.520 --> 01:01.900
♪ Turning back, you and I ♪

01:05.740 --> 01:07.270
♪ Seize the current moment ♪

01:07.270 --> 01:10.920
♪ The sky is painted
with a gentle pallet of pastel colors ♪

01:10.920 --> 01:15.920
♪ Let's walk together ♪

01:16.360 --> 01:17.970
♪ Even if ♪

01:17.970 --> 01:21.660
♪ The snow in front of us ♪

01:21.680 --> 01:23.170
♪ Will dye our hair white ♪

01:23.170 --> 01:27.210
♪ In an instant ♪

01:27.210 --> 01:28.310
[Joy of Life Season 2]

01:28.310 --> 01:30.780
[Adapted from Mao Ni's Joy of Life
on Yuewen Group's Qidian platform]

01:30.780 --> 01:34.300
[Episode 30]

01:36.000 --> 01:37.880
Are you Sigu Jian's younger brother?

01:39.936 --> 01:41.299
You ran out of poison smoke bombs.

01:41.319 --> 01:42.739
You ran out of crossbow bolts.

01:42.759 --> 01:45.160
You ran out of silver needles,
which you hid in your hair.

01:45.360 --> 01:47.379
Now, you only have a dagger.

01:47.399 --> 01:48.960
What else do you wish to do?

01:52.599 --> 01:54.399
The Imperial Guards will arrive soon.

01:57.159 --> 01:58.800
I have more than enough time.

03:45.800 --> 03:46.880
Fan Xian,

03:47.080 --> 03:49.079
what's with the disruption
in your qi flow?

05:22.480 --> 05:23.800
How is it?

05:23.879 --> 05:25.000
Your Majesty,

05:25.360 --> 05:26.500
we're in trouble.

05:26.520 --> 05:28.210
He was only stabbed once, no?

05:28.230 --> 05:29.439
The dagger was coated with poison.

05:29.439 --> 05:30.950
Give him the antidote, then.

05:31.160 --> 05:32.940
We still don't know
what kind of poison it is.

05:32.960 --> 05:35.550
I went to Fan's Residence before this.

05:35.570 --> 05:37.970
Back then, I already found out that
his internal energy was in disarray.

05:37.990 --> 05:40.220
His pulses and meridians
were flowing in reverse.

05:40.860 --> 05:42.099
I've checked many medical textbooks

05:42.119 --> 05:44.340
when I returned to
the Imperial Academy of Medicine.

05:44.360 --> 05:45.820
Only then was I able to confirm

05:45.840 --> 05:49.539
that Mr. Fan's qi flow
was no longer under his control,

05:49.559 --> 05:52.260
causing his internal energy
to flow in reverse.

05:52.280 --> 05:53.340
After that battle,

05:53.360 --> 05:57.099
Mr. Fan lost control of his qi flow.

05:57.119 --> 05:59.659
He suffered external injuries
and was poisoned as well.

05:59.679 --> 06:02.219
Each of the conditions alone
is grievous enough.

06:02.239 --> 06:05.079
Moreover, he had all of the conditions.

06:06.160 --> 06:09.839
Are you sure he has lost
all of his qi flow?

06:09.960 --> 06:11.399
I'm sure of it.

06:14.639 --> 06:16.440
What will happen, then?

06:16.920 --> 06:18.519
There's one solution.

06:18.600 --> 06:20.260
We can find someone

06:20.280 --> 06:22.880
who possesses the same qi flow as him.

06:23.400 --> 06:26.440
We can make him expand his qi flow

06:26.559 --> 06:29.599
to reconstruct Mr. Fan's meridians.

06:29.800 --> 06:33.320
Although this might damage
the individual's qi flow,

06:33.360 --> 06:36.719
he can save Mr. Fan's life.

06:37.720 --> 06:39.619
A person who possesses
the same qi flow as him?

06:39.639 --> 06:40.700
That's right.

06:40.720 --> 06:42.399
I don't think there's another person

06:43.319 --> 06:45.399
in the world
who has the same qi flow as him.

06:47.639 --> 06:49.159
It'll be difficult, then.

06:51.600 --> 06:53.519
If so, you can join him
in the afterlife.

06:54.840 --> 06:55.920
Your Majesty!

07:43.559 --> 07:45.000
Find Ruoruo.

07:56.160 --> 07:59.040
It depends on your fate now.

08:17.319 --> 08:19.680
This is Fan Ruoruo,
daughter of the Fan family.

08:26.879 --> 08:28.279
May we speak in private?

08:36.000 --> 08:38.000
Miss Ruoruo, do you practice medicine?

08:38.010 --> 08:39.330
My brother taught me about it before.

08:39.350 --> 08:40.860
If so, do you know
how to neutralize poison?

08:40.880 --> 08:41.370
I don't.

08:41.390 --> 08:42.980
What about restoring reversed qi flow?

08:43.000 --> 08:43.699
I don't know.

08:43.719 --> 08:44.719
How can you save him, then?

08:44.719 --> 08:45.699
I cannot save him.

08:45.719 --> 08:47.250
The only person
who can save him is himself.

08:47.270 --> 08:49.680
The only thing I can do
is to help him regain consciousness.

08:58.839 --> 09:01.440
If so, miss, what do you plan to do?

09:02.079 --> 09:03.459
Xian once told me

09:03.479 --> 09:06.520
that there's an acupoint that stimulates
the mind and clears consciousness.

09:07.079 --> 09:10.839
If so, how many patients
have you treated with this method before?

09:11.880 --> 09:13.119
None.

09:14.400 --> 09:16.400
This is too risky!

09:21.199 --> 09:22.680
Can he regain consciousness

09:23.240 --> 09:24.560
without acupuncture?

09:24.599 --> 09:25.679
It's difficult.

09:27.559 --> 09:29.160
If so, there's no need to hesitate.

09:51.599 --> 09:52.179
Scatter.

09:52.199 --> 09:53.279
Scatter!

09:57.959 --> 09:59.359
Hurry!

10:03.800 --> 10:04.880
How is it?

10:07.839 --> 10:09.800
He's not an outsider.
Feel free to speak.

10:12.340 --> 10:13.939
Fan Xian has regained consciousness.

10:13.959 --> 10:15.299
He spoke just now.

10:15.319 --> 10:16.479
He said

10:16.510 --> 10:18.880
he wanted Leng of the Third Division
to enter the palace.

10:19.520 --> 10:20.600
Okay.

10:22.120 --> 10:24.839
The white-clad assassin
who hurt Fan Xian has vanished.

10:25.079 --> 10:27.479
But we can confirm
that he's still in the Capital.

10:28.599 --> 10:30.160
Continue your investigation.

10:30.439 --> 10:31.680
That individual

10:32.000 --> 10:33.719
is Sigu Jian's younger brother.

10:35.479 --> 10:37.760
His Majesty's judgment is never wrong.

10:39.040 --> 10:41.059
His skills are beyond
that of a ninth-grade master.

10:41.079 --> 10:42.400
He's hiding in the Capital,

10:43.000 --> 10:45.320
yet the Imperial Inspectorate
has no idea where he is.

10:47.559 --> 10:49.239
There's more to it than meets the eye.

10:49.839 --> 10:51.479
I need to find an answer to this.

10:52.760 --> 10:55.260
He's very familiar
with the Imperial Guards' deployment.

10:55.280 --> 10:57.839
What do you think that means?

11:01.760 --> 11:03.280
There's a mole.

11:05.240 --> 11:06.879
I investigated his profile.

11:09.359 --> 11:10.520
What's the result?

11:10.640 --> 11:11.959
It was blank.

11:12.080 --> 11:13.440
That doesn't make sense.

11:13.520 --> 11:14.579
Figures like him

11:14.599 --> 11:16.900
will always have some written records
left behind.

11:16.920 --> 11:18.000
So?

11:18.240 --> 11:19.640
So I suspect that his spy

11:19.679 --> 11:22.320
is working for the Imperial Inspectorate.

11:22.719 --> 11:25.140
Documents related to Sigu Jian

11:25.160 --> 11:27.680
can only be retrieved by me

11:27.760 --> 11:29.479
and the division supervisors.

11:34.520 --> 11:36.119
Maybe his spy

11:36.719 --> 11:38.479
is one of the division supervisors.

11:38.800 --> 11:39.490
Mr. Chen,

11:39.510 --> 11:41.400
I wish to launch a secret investigation.

11:43.800 --> 11:46.079
Why are you skipping me?

11:46.230 --> 11:48.160
Anyone else
might try to betray the state

11:48.520 --> 11:49.980
except for you, Mr. Chen.

11:50.000 --> 11:51.140
But why?

11:51.160 --> 11:52.210
Mr. Chen, it's because

11:52.230 --> 11:53.839
you hold justice in your heart.

11:58.100 --> 11:59.140
Continue your investigation.

11:59.160 --> 12:00.240
Yes, Mr. Chen.

12:21.079 --> 12:22.280
I'm here!

12:22.439 --> 12:23.640
I'm here!

12:30.000 --> 12:31.119
Xian?

12:31.479 --> 12:33.999
Leng, did you not take any poison today?

12:34.350 --> 12:35.860
Luckily, I didn't take any poison today.

12:35.880 --> 12:37.459
If not, I wouldn't be able to come.

12:37.479 --> 12:40.100
Xian, do you know
the kind of poison you were struck with?

12:40.120 --> 12:40.940
I do.

12:40.960 --> 12:42.879
Good. That means it can be neutralized.

12:43.439 --> 12:44.939
The dagger was coated with

12:44.959 --> 12:47.719
saltpeter poison.

12:49.880 --> 12:52.059
That's commonly used by Dongyi City.

12:52.079 --> 12:54.560
The assassin was
Sigu Jian's younger brother.

12:56.120 --> 12:58.719
His identity doesn't matter.
I'll neutralize your poison first.

13:00.640 --> 13:01.740
Although Dongyi City

13:01.760 --> 13:03.419
uses rare poison,

13:03.439 --> 13:05.400
the Third Division can deal with it.

13:06.800 --> 13:08.400
Why don't we test it first?

13:09.520 --> 13:11.040
I trust Leng.

13:18.959 --> 13:21.079
That's for internal use.
I'll make medicine for external use now.

13:21.079 --> 13:22.320
I have to grind it here.

13:36.000 --> 13:37.760
His poison isn't neutralized.

13:38.870 --> 13:40.820
[Leng, Interim Division Supervisor of Third Division]
How could that be?

13:40.839 --> 13:42.359
Seems like

13:42.479 --> 13:44.880
the poison has entered my lungs.

13:44.880 --> 13:46.070
Entered your lungs?

13:46.090 --> 13:47.100
How can we treat it, then?

13:47.120 --> 13:50.140
Actually, I'll be fine with surgery.

13:50.160 --> 13:51.900
What's surgery?

13:51.920 --> 13:53.579
A method where you cut open the wound

13:53.599 --> 13:55.280
and clean the lungs.

13:55.479 --> 13:57.579
No one neutralizes poison like that.

13:57.599 --> 13:59.959
Won't you die
if someone cut open your wound?

14:00.199 --> 14:01.740
I'll die anyway

14:01.760 --> 14:03.280
if we do nothing about it.

14:03.679 --> 14:05.500
I've never heard of this before.

14:05.520 --> 14:07.119
Who can do it?

14:07.400 --> 14:08.999
We need someone

14:09.439 --> 14:11.760
who has stable hands.

14:23.679 --> 14:24.759
I'll do it.

14:26.359 --> 14:28.560
My hands are the most stable among them.

14:29.160 --> 14:30.680
The scene will be

14:30.880 --> 14:32.479
quite bloody later.

14:33.400 --> 14:34.480
Wan'er,

14:34.959 --> 14:36.719
why don't you head outside first?

14:39.120 --> 14:40.520
I'll keep you company.

14:44.079 --> 14:45.800
How confident are you?

14:49.439 --> 14:50.179
My goodness.

14:50.199 --> 14:52.119
Even you have no confidence in it?

14:53.160 --> 14:54.599
I'll die for sure

14:54.920 --> 14:56.599
if we don't give it a try.

14:58.959 --> 15:00.359
We have to give it a try.

15:03.599 --> 15:04.800
Do it.

15:15.520 --> 15:16.600
Wait.

15:17.920 --> 15:19.440
Before that,

15:19.839 --> 15:21.599
there are several things

15:21.719 --> 15:23.400
you need to prepare.

15:24.439 --> 15:25.519
Tell us.

15:26.319 --> 15:27.560
Slowly.

15:34.679 --> 15:36.199
You need a surgical bed.

15:38.479 --> 15:39.740
A surgical shadowless lamp.

15:39.760 --> 15:40.999
What?

15:42.120 --> 15:43.920
Comprehensive disinfection.

15:46.640 --> 15:49.400
Can you all be nicer to me?

15:49.800 --> 15:51.959
She's going to split open my chest.

15:52.479 --> 15:53.920
At least

15:54.359 --> 15:56.320
you all should clean up the area.

15:56.920 --> 15:58.339
Okay.

15:58.359 --> 16:00.939
In this world, germ exists.

16:00.959 --> 16:02.199
What's a germ?

16:03.400 --> 16:06.560
Germs cannot be seen with the naked eye.

16:07.640 --> 16:08.879
What germs?

16:09.040 --> 16:09.660
Cut the crap.

16:09.680 --> 16:10.980
Just follow his instructions.

16:11.000 --> 16:12.080
Okay.

16:12.240 --> 16:13.520
Lie down.

16:31.559 --> 16:32.620
Xian,

16:32.640 --> 16:34.920
I've wiped the area
with detoxifying powder

16:35.079 --> 16:38.280
and fumed the area
with soul-avoiding incense.

16:38.359 --> 16:40.459
I've cleaned up the area
as per your instruction.

16:40.479 --> 16:44.800
I think the germs are gone now.

16:45.760 --> 16:46.999
The medicine is ready.

16:51.280 --> 16:52.920
Nux vomica won't do.

16:53.640 --> 16:55.079
I'll fall asleep.

16:55.280 --> 16:57.420
How can she split open your chest
if you're not asleep?

16:57.440 --> 16:58.959
I can't afford to be asleep.

16:59.599 --> 17:01.320
I have to direct

17:01.479 --> 17:02.920
the surgery.

17:03.839 --> 17:05.599
Can't you do it yourself?

17:05.687 --> 17:07.446
But I've only done it on fruits before.

17:07.680 --> 17:08.760
Leng,

17:09.559 --> 17:11.240
we should use chloroform.

17:11.720 --> 17:12.800
All right.

17:14.919 --> 17:17.879
No one dared use it in this manner

17:18.000 --> 17:19.819
since ancient times.

17:19.839 --> 17:23.359
We'll set a precedent today.

17:49.800 --> 17:51.839
You have to help Ruoruo
wipe away her sweat.

17:52.399 --> 17:54.079
She's the main surgeon here.

17:55.200 --> 17:56.280
Xian.

17:57.720 --> 17:58.919
Let's begin.

18:02.079 --> 18:02.940
It's fine.

18:02.960 --> 18:04.099
Let's begin.

18:04.119 --> 18:05.199
Xian.

18:06.280 --> 18:07.439
Don't be nervous.

18:09.440 --> 18:10.500
- Be careful.
- Xian!

18:10.520 --> 18:12.280
Are... Are you okay?

18:13.159 --> 18:14.240
I'm fine.

18:15.200 --> 18:16.280
I'm fine.

18:29.480 --> 18:31.639
Why aren't you doing it?

18:32.639 --> 18:34.320
Draw... Draw a line.

18:34.760 --> 18:36.679
Your hands are quite stable.

18:36.800 --> 18:38.500
But I've only done it on fruits before.

18:38.520 --> 18:40.260
It's fine. That's more than enough.

18:40.280 --> 18:40.940
Don't be scared.

18:40.960 --> 18:42.099
I'm not scared.

18:42.119 --> 18:44.260
I just don't know how thick
the human skin and flesh is.

18:44.280 --> 18:46.040
I don't know how to make the first cut.

18:47.240 --> 18:49.079
I should've gotten you
a pig before this.

18:49.319 --> 18:50.760
What should we do now?

18:51.680 --> 18:52.760
Xian.

19:14.960 --> 19:16.040
Continue.

19:29.800 --> 19:30.880
Bring it back.

19:44.760 --> 19:45.899
If he's sleepy,

19:45.919 --> 19:47.280
let him sleep.

19:50.280 --> 19:51.859
Fan Xian saved his life.

19:51.879 --> 19:53.359
How could he just go to sleep?

19:53.599 --> 19:54.679
I'm not sleepy.

19:55.040 --> 19:56.059
Mother,

19:56.079 --> 19:58.040
is Cousin Xian okay?

20:19.919 --> 20:20.999
Wait...

20:21.040 --> 20:23.079
What's with all the blood?

20:23.440 --> 20:26.520
Good people are blessed by the heavens.

20:47.000 --> 20:49.399
Master, have some tea.

20:49.680 --> 20:50.879
I'm not thirsty.

20:51.879 --> 20:54.119
Listen to your own voice.

20:58.119 --> 20:59.199
It's hot.

21:03.200 --> 21:04.320
It's fine.

21:06.919 --> 21:07.999
Master,

21:08.480 --> 21:11.299
if you're worried,
you should visit him in the palace.

21:11.319 --> 21:12.399
I can't do so.

21:12.480 --> 21:14.059
But he's your son.

21:14.079 --> 21:16.040
He's in the palace.

21:16.280 --> 21:18.590
I cannot enter the palace
without any permission.

21:18.919 --> 21:20.560
Not even to visit your son?

21:20.720 --> 21:22.399
That's precisely why

21:22.440 --> 21:23.610
I can't do it.

21:23.630 --> 21:25.700
There are plenty
of imperial physicians there.

21:25.720 --> 21:28.079
Why must they ask Ruoruo to treat him?

21:29.440 --> 21:30.800
Everything will be fine.

21:32.639 --> 21:34.399
I'm sure everything will be fine.

21:36.720 --> 21:37.960
It's hot!

21:47.680 --> 21:49.119
What's wrong?

21:51.480 --> 21:53.099
According to His Majesty's oral edict,

21:53.119 --> 21:55.800
Fan Xian is injured.
He is not to be disturbed.

21:56.190 --> 21:58.760
Your Highness and the rest,
please return to your residence.

21:58.800 --> 21:59.780
Please come again next time.

21:59.800 --> 22:01.439
How's his condition?

22:01.720 --> 22:04.359
His chest has been split open.

22:04.440 --> 22:05.800
If so, Fan Xian is...

22:06.399 --> 22:07.879
Mr. Fan is

22:07.950 --> 22:09.240
enjoying himself.

22:09.680 --> 22:10.700
Enjoying himself?

22:10.720 --> 22:12.020
His chest was split open.

22:12.040 --> 22:13.280
What is he enjoying?

22:21.200 --> 22:23.399
What is he laughing at?

22:36.480 --> 22:38.099
The chloroform we used

22:38.119 --> 22:39.520
is a hallucinogenic drug.

22:39.800 --> 22:41.760
I think he's hallucinating now.

22:58.240 --> 23:00.480
Xian, your wound is bleeding.

23:02.910 --> 23:04.240
Neutralize the poison.

23:06.159 --> 23:07.399
Stop the bleeding.

23:10.919 --> 23:13.800
After that, stitch up my wound
using the skills I taught you.

23:17.319 --> 23:18.639
Don't be nervous.

23:18.680 --> 23:19.960
I trust you.

23:21.399 --> 23:22.479
Okay.

23:23.960 --> 23:25.280
Stitch it up?

23:25.559 --> 23:26.700
With what?

23:26.720 --> 23:27.370
A needle.

23:27.390 --> 23:28.740
What kind of thread will you use, then?

23:28.760 --> 23:29.780
Cotton and linen thread?

23:29.800 --> 23:30.780
Mulberry bark thread.

23:30.800 --> 23:31.980
Mulberry bark thread?

23:32.000 --> 23:32.750
How do you make that?

23:32.760 --> 23:34.619
By using the mulberry root
with its bark removed.

23:34.639 --> 23:37.000
A thread is made from
the internal bindings of the roots.

23:37.040 --> 23:38.800
In the end, it'll form a thread.

23:39.079 --> 23:40.159
Just like this.

23:40.200 --> 23:42.040
How exactly is that done?

23:42.399 --> 23:43.990
Let Ruoruo focus on
the treatment for now.

23:44.010 --> 23:46.339
She can tell you
everything you want to know after this.

23:46.359 --> 23:48.599
You're right. I was negligent.

23:48.639 --> 23:50.839
Please focus on saving him.

23:58.079 --> 23:59.159
Wan'er.

24:01.000 --> 24:02.059
What's wrong?

24:02.079 --> 24:03.399
Do you feel sick?

24:10.079 --> 24:11.359
You looked better

24:12.399 --> 24:13.679
in the past.

24:22.760 --> 24:24.480
Library.

24:27.000 --> 24:28.599
Ice cream.

24:29.159 --> 24:30.439
Class is over!

24:30.839 --> 24:32.240
Buddies, mark my attendance

24:32.440 --> 24:34.960
for me later. I'll take a nap.

24:39.359 --> 24:41.119
This is...

24:42.680 --> 24:44.839
Your Majesty,
Mr. Chen requests an audience.

24:47.879 --> 24:49.560
The class teacher is here.

24:54.440 --> 24:55.639
Your Majesty?

24:56.440 --> 24:58.200
What are you doing here?

25:03.110 --> 25:04.439
What does that mean?

25:04.800 --> 25:06.480
YYDS.
[*What an outstanding man]

25:29.720 --> 25:30.839
Your Majesty,

25:30.879 --> 25:33.260
we've identified the three assassins.

25:33.280 --> 25:35.260
Fan Xian is having his chest split open

25:35.280 --> 25:37.520
in Guangxin Palace now.

25:38.040 --> 25:39.760
If this medical skill
can be passed down,

25:39.760 --> 25:42.919
it would be a great blessing
for the state.

25:45.440 --> 25:47.599
It's strange.

25:47.720 --> 25:50.220
Fan Xian wouldn't have the chance
to show his talent

25:50.240 --> 25:53.399
if his condition wasn't this serious.

25:57.860 --> 25:59.280
He takes after his mother.

26:02.879 --> 26:04.280
Do you think Fan Xian

26:04.280 --> 26:06.819
excels at any other fields?

26:06.839 --> 26:09.660
Your Majesty, he would dedicate
all of his talents to you.

26:09.680 --> 26:10.760
Is that so?

26:10.839 --> 26:13.660
He's willing to sacrifice his life
to save you, Your Majesty.

26:13.680 --> 26:15.760
What's more important than one's life?

26:19.040 --> 26:20.180
You do have a point.

26:20.200 --> 26:21.280
Come inside.

27:34.559 --> 27:35.720
Talk to us.

27:44.440 --> 27:46.119
His condition has stabilized.

28:03.200 --> 28:04.520
I did it correctly.

28:09.440 --> 28:10.639
Miss Fan,

28:10.919 --> 28:13.919
your medical skills
can even ward off death.

28:14.200 --> 28:15.359
Forgive my boldness,

28:15.359 --> 28:19.139
but Miss Fan, please impart
this medical skill to us

28:19.159 --> 28:21.280
for the sake of the people.

28:23.280 --> 28:24.720
I'll ask Xian about it

28:24.960 --> 28:26.399
once he wakes up.

28:28.800 --> 28:30.359
I'll wake him up right now.

28:30.420 --> 28:32.730
He's seriously wounded.
This is inappropriate of you.

28:33.559 --> 28:35.420
I'm ashamed.

28:35.440 --> 28:37.500
I'm so muddle-headed.

28:37.520 --> 28:39.660
I was only thinking
of inheriting the medical skill.

28:39.680 --> 28:41.539
Enough already.
Keep all these things away.

28:41.559 --> 28:42.059
All right.

28:42.079 --> 28:44.000
Let Xian rest.

28:44.359 --> 28:45.639
Here.

28:47.639 --> 28:50.059
- Mr. Fan should rest well.
- Just go.

28:50.079 --> 28:52.800
I'll deliver the medicine here tomorrow.

28:52.800 --> 28:54.200
Why are you so studious?

29:02.399 --> 29:03.800
Your lips...

29:08.919 --> 29:11.720
I was too nervous. I bit my own lips.

29:14.040 --> 29:15.320
Me too.

29:17.879 --> 29:19.639
The surgery is already over.

29:21.800 --> 29:23.760
But the sense of fear
only struck me by now.

30:10.040 --> 30:10.750
Master,

30:10.770 --> 30:12.220
we received urgent news from the palace.

30:12.240 --> 30:14.059
Fan Xian's condition
has been stabilized.

30:14.079 --> 30:15.599
His life is out of danger now.

30:24.490 --> 30:25.919
I expected this to happen.

30:29.280 --> 30:30.379
You were the only one panicking.

30:30.399 --> 30:31.780
I told you already.

30:31.800 --> 30:33.399
We must be steady

30:33.680 --> 30:35.599
no matter what we do.

30:37.119 --> 30:38.560
This is great.

30:40.119 --> 30:41.919
The toughest ordeal

30:42.200 --> 30:43.280
is over.

30:44.079 --> 30:44.819
Master,

30:44.839 --> 30:46.319
I think I should head to the palace.

30:46.319 --> 30:47.660
Someone has to take care of him.

30:47.680 --> 30:49.059
Both Ruoruo and Wan'er
are already there.

30:49.079 --> 30:50.099
I think I can go as well.

30:50.119 --> 30:51.199
No!

30:52.399 --> 30:54.579
Why not?

30:54.599 --> 30:57.386
Fan Xian bowed to me
when he got married.

30:57.406 --> 30:59.247
That means I'm his mother now!

31:44.960 --> 31:47.560
Wan'er and Ruoruo are
resting in the side chamber.

31:48.319 --> 31:49.839
It was tough

31:50.159 --> 31:51.859
persuading them

31:51.879 --> 31:53.460
not to look after you.

31:53.480 --> 31:55.079
You came at the right timing.

31:55.680 --> 31:57.280
I just regained consciousness.

31:57.800 --> 31:59.839
The Third Division

32:01.040 --> 32:02.280
told me

32:02.720 --> 32:04.960
about the effect of the chloroform.

32:05.710 --> 32:08.020
I came here after calculating
how long it would last.

32:09.919 --> 32:11.359
How do you feel now?

32:21.680 --> 32:23.079
It hurts.

32:24.079 --> 32:25.280
Anything else?

32:34.480 --> 32:36.000
I lost my qi flow.

32:36.110 --> 32:37.879
Your pulses and meridians are messy.

32:38.280 --> 32:40.000
And, your qi flow has dissipated.

32:41.200 --> 32:42.320
Luckily,

32:42.760 --> 32:43.940
you survived.

32:43.960 --> 32:45.180
Can I recover it?

32:45.200 --> 32:47.220
Maybe with Ku He's unique technique,

32:47.240 --> 32:48.679
One Heaven.

32:49.559 --> 32:50.639
Rumor has it

32:51.040 --> 32:53.460
that it could help recover
one's foundation.

32:53.480 --> 32:54.619
Does he impart it to outsiders?

32:54.639 --> 32:55.879
Never.

32:59.159 --> 33:00.879
I guess I can dream about it, then.

33:04.280 --> 33:06.560
We've identified the assassins
in Hanging Temple.

33:07.240 --> 33:08.370
His Majesty said

33:08.390 --> 33:10.439
he wanted you
to hear about it immediately.

33:13.680 --> 33:15.679
I'm all ears.

33:18.119 --> 33:19.199
Firstly,

33:20.159 --> 33:21.399
that guard,

33:21.870 --> 33:23.139
he's from Hu, a foreign state.

33:23.159 --> 33:24.020
He doesn't look like it.

33:24.040 --> 33:25.390
He has the blood of Qing as well.

33:25.410 --> 33:27.099
That's why you can't tell
from his appearance alone.

33:27.119 --> 33:28.579
How did he become a palace guard?

33:28.599 --> 33:31.000
Back then, the Qing State engaged
the Hu people in battle.

33:31.280 --> 33:32.180
We had the upper hand.

33:32.200 --> 33:34.940
The Hu people sent a team to the Capital

33:34.960 --> 33:36.379
to surrender and seek peace.

33:36.399 --> 33:37.800
They failed.

33:37.919 --> 33:39.579
The Qing State won gloriously

33:39.599 --> 33:41.460
while the Hu people were exiled.

33:41.480 --> 33:43.539
He remained in the Capital since then.

33:43.559 --> 33:45.079
As times changed,

33:45.800 --> 33:47.960
he became a palace guard
for some reason.

33:47.970 --> 33:49.990
Who handled the procedure
when he was introduced to the palace?

33:50.000 --> 33:52.579
The person in charge was dead.
This was an unsolved case.

33:52.599 --> 33:53.899
Why didn't he strike all these years?

33:53.919 --> 33:55.020
He had no chance.

33:55.040 --> 33:56.040
There were too many guards.

33:56.040 --> 33:58.500
He only had a slim chance
of approaching His Majesty.

33:58.520 --> 33:59.619
This was just a coincidence.

33:59.639 --> 34:00.960
What about that eunuch?

34:02.919 --> 34:04.667
He's closely related to you.

34:04.687 --> 34:05.700
I don't know him.

34:05.720 --> 34:07.539
Back then, your mother's passing

34:07.559 --> 34:10.419
triggered a massacre in the Capital.

34:10.439 --> 34:14.019
All those who were involved
were slain by the Black Cavalries.

34:14.039 --> 34:14.720
This eunuch

34:14.720 --> 34:17.066
was the descendant of Duke Wang.

34:17.086 --> 34:18.339
He was rescued by their servants.

34:18.359 --> 34:20.459
He returned to the Capital
after coming of age.

34:20.479 --> 34:22.780
He joined the palace
and became a eunuch.

34:22.800 --> 34:24.039
To seek revenge?

34:31.640 --> 34:32.800
Vengeance

34:33.359 --> 34:35.240
is the most resilient force.

34:36.280 --> 34:38.439
It grows in one's heart.

34:38.680 --> 34:40.519
It gets stronger over time.

34:41.039 --> 34:42.519
In the end, it'll end up

34:42.999 --> 34:44.839
being the only goal

34:44.999 --> 34:46.240
of one's life.

34:46.800 --> 34:48.280
Why does it sound like

34:48.399 --> 34:50.039
you resonated with that fact?

34:52.240 --> 34:53.919
I was just analyzing

34:54.879 --> 34:57.039
the thoughts of the assassins.

34:57.519 --> 34:58.979
How did he hide the dagger, then?

34:58.999 --> 35:02.339
He was responsible for cleaning
the Hanging Temple three years ago.

35:02.359 --> 35:04.650
He hid the dagger there back then.

35:04.670 --> 35:06.670
He was only able to utilize it
during his encounter with you.

35:06.680 --> 35:08.380
What about the white-clad assassin?

35:09.720 --> 35:11.320
His Majesty has a unique insight.

35:11.600 --> 35:14.586
That person is
Sigu Jan's younger brother.

35:14.606 --> 35:16.019
Was Sigu Jian behind it this time?

35:16.039 --> 35:18.180
This time, it wasn't Sigu Jian.

35:18.200 --> 35:20.100
Sigu Jian slew his entire tribe.

35:20.120 --> 35:21.819
He spared no one
but his younger brother.

35:21.839 --> 35:24.320
The only person
who wants to kill Sigu Jian

35:24.439 --> 35:26.140
is his younger brother.

35:26.160 --> 35:28.019
Do the three of them know each other?

35:28.039 --> 35:29.180
They don't.

35:29.200 --> 35:30.060
They're not connected.

35:30.080 --> 35:31.800
What's with their chemistry, then?

35:35.240 --> 35:37.899
It was a coincidence. There was
no discussion or premeditation.

35:37.919 --> 35:39.380
All three of them
didn't know each other.

35:39.400 --> 35:41.100
They tried
to assassinate the target in turns.

35:41.120 --> 35:42.959
By starting together,

35:43.039 --> 35:44.999
it ended up being a dangerous situation.

35:45.080 --> 35:47.160
This encounter is arranged by a deity.

35:47.640 --> 35:48.810
There's no way to predict it,

35:48.830 --> 35:50.399
and there's no way to replicate it.

35:50.800 --> 35:52.800
A deity, huh?

35:53.280 --> 35:55.100
Such coincidences

35:55.120 --> 35:57.559
and encounters

35:57.919 --> 35:59.680
cannot be arranged by mere mortals.

36:00.000 --> 36:01.840
Mere mortals might not be able to do it,

36:03.720 --> 36:05.080
but you can.

36:07.760 --> 36:09.600
You mustn't say things like that.

36:10.200 --> 36:11.999
I'm not that capable.

36:12.479 --> 36:13.939
Even if I'm capable of that...

36:13.959 --> 36:16.039
Shadow was the one who stabbed me.

36:35.080 --> 36:37.039
I saw Shadow's attack before.

36:37.879 --> 36:39.399
It was hard to tell

36:39.800 --> 36:41.439
when he was using a sword.

36:41.999 --> 36:43.590
But after he cast his sword away,

36:44.160 --> 36:45.680
he gave himself away.

36:47.399 --> 36:49.160
Arranged by a deity?

36:49.879 --> 36:51.399
Does this deity

36:52.600 --> 36:54.559
use a wheelchair?

37:11.920 --> 37:13.819
Stop staring.
I just regained consciousness.

37:13.839 --> 37:15.210
I can't hide anyone here.

37:15.230 --> 37:16.720
There are only the two of us.

37:21.760 --> 37:23.519
You were too reckless.

37:23.640 --> 37:25.020
Your qi flow has dissipated,

37:25.040 --> 37:26.979
and you haven't recovered
from your injury.

37:26.999 --> 37:29.160
What if I was the one who set it up?

37:36.879 --> 37:38.160
What would you do?

37:38.319 --> 37:39.540
Was it you?

37:39.560 --> 37:41.039
I only dispatched Shadow.

37:42.080 --> 37:43.399
The other two

37:43.839 --> 37:45.180
were pure coincidences.

37:45.200 --> 37:46.580
You wished to kill me?

37:46.600 --> 37:47.680
Not me.

37:47.760 --> 37:49.700
Shadow always wanted to spar with Wuzhu.

37:49.720 --> 37:50.700
But he had no chance.

37:50.720 --> 37:53.439
As you're his only disciple,
he'll take it as a close second.

37:54.600 --> 37:56.160
That stab was an accident.

37:56.879 --> 37:59.120
You suddenly lost your qi flow.

37:59.439 --> 38:01.280
He couldn't stop himself in time.

38:03.919 --> 38:05.999
So it was just an accident, right?

38:09.160 --> 38:10.760
It's definitely an accident.

38:23.090 --> 38:25.170
If so, were you trying
to assassinate the ruler?

38:26.560 --> 38:28.439
His Majesty has great trust in me.

38:28.879 --> 38:30.160
I have no reason to assassinate him.

38:30.180 --> 38:31.260
That depends on you entirely.

38:31.280 --> 38:33.710
What's the most important thing
about being a subject?

38:34.080 --> 38:35.160
Loyalty.

38:35.440 --> 38:37.160
It's to share His Majesty's burden.

38:39.519 --> 38:41.280
Let me reorganize my thoughts.

38:41.440 --> 38:42.800
You trying to assassinate His Majesty

38:42.820 --> 38:44.939
is actually an attempt
to share his burden with him?

38:44.959 --> 38:47.160
Does that mean His Majesty
is tired of living?

38:47.180 --> 38:48.710
Do you still remember
the fire that occurred?

38:48.720 --> 38:50.180
Hurry! Put out the fire!

38:50.200 --> 38:51.220
Hurry!

38:51.240 --> 38:51.939
Quickly!

38:51.959 --> 38:53.419
We were able to locate

38:53.439 --> 38:54.600
all three of the assassins.

38:54.620 --> 38:55.900
The fire source was the only thing

38:55.920 --> 38:57.680
that the Imperial Inspectorate
couldn't identify

38:57.680 --> 38:59.680
even after dispatching everyone we had.

39:00.240 --> 39:02.959
More interestingly, after the report
was submitted to His Majesty,

39:03.399 --> 39:04.939
he never questioned it.

39:04.959 --> 39:06.580
He glossed it over.

39:06.600 --> 39:07.979
Did His Majesty set the fire?

39:07.999 --> 39:10.439
His Majesty never
makes a pointless move.

39:10.999 --> 39:12.320
That fire wasn't enough.

39:12.760 --> 39:14.499
That's why you were stabbed by Shadow.

39:14.519 --> 39:16.080
What do you mean by that?

39:17.519 --> 39:19.640
Setting fire
and assassinating the ruler?

39:20.039 --> 39:21.800
What result did he want to get?

39:23.120 --> 39:25.039
The assassination in Hanging Temple

39:25.359 --> 39:27.039
shocked the imperial court.

39:27.360 --> 39:28.959
Someone has to be responsible

39:28.999 --> 39:30.680
for this incident.

39:30.760 --> 39:32.160
This is the result.

40:01.720 --> 40:02.499
Gong Dian?

40:02.519 --> 40:04.230
Commander of the Imperial Guards,

40:04.439 --> 40:06.240
failed to protect the ruler.

40:06.479 --> 40:08.039
He's to be executed.

40:16.479 --> 40:18.120
Your Majesty, please take care!

40:18.399 --> 40:19.479
I shall

40:19.560 --> 40:20.800
take my leave!

40:25.670 --> 40:26.979
Was he trying to kill Gong Dian?

40:26.999 --> 40:28.520
He was kicked out of the Capital

40:28.560 --> 40:29.919
and banished to Dingzhou.

40:30.270 --> 40:31.839
He was to join the border army.

40:39.200 --> 40:40.499
I don't understand.

40:40.519 --> 40:42.190
Did he cause all of that commotion

40:42.280 --> 40:43.780
just to target Gong Dian?

40:43.800 --> 40:45.760
He's Ye Zhong's junior.

40:45.999 --> 40:47.079
Ye Zhong

40:47.240 --> 40:49.839
submitted eight memorials
to the throne in a row.

40:50.200 --> 40:51.700
He suffered the same fate as Gong Dian.

40:51.720 --> 40:53.580
He was banished to Dingzhou last night.

40:53.600 --> 40:55.198
He was to join the border army as well.

40:55.218 --> 40:56.859
The Ye family is done for.

40:56.879 --> 40:58.760
Is that His Majesty's goal?

40:59.080 --> 41:00.200
Wait.

41:00.720 --> 41:02.810
Ye Liuyun is a member
of the Ye family too.

41:02.830 --> 41:04.660
Why would His Majesty
want to offend a grandmaster?

41:04.680 --> 41:07.800
Only His Majesty understands
his own intentions.

41:09.560 --> 41:10.859
Last question.

41:10.879 --> 41:13.030
Shadow is Sigu Jian's younger brother.

41:13.050 --> 41:14.140
Does His Majesty know about that?

41:14.160 --> 41:14.900
No, he doesn't.

41:14.920 --> 41:16.090
He has issued an edict to arrest him.

41:16.100 --> 41:17.900
What's the difference between this
and assassinating the ruler?

41:17.910 --> 41:19.479
For His Majesty's sake,

41:19.560 --> 41:22.120
I don't mind shocking His Majesty.

41:22.130 --> 41:23.750
That doesn't sound like
what a loyal subject will say.

41:23.760 --> 41:24.939
The result is the most important.

41:24.959 --> 41:26.800
What if he did stab His Majesty?

41:28.999 --> 41:30.600
His Majesty won't die from it.

41:31.680 --> 41:34.519
No one knows the trump cards
His Majesty hides under his sleeves.

41:37.760 --> 41:40.560
Should I tell His Majesty
about Shadow's true identity?

41:40.580 --> 41:41.740
You may choose not to tell him.

41:41.760 --> 41:43.620
If so, you shouldn't
have admitted to it.

41:46.760 --> 41:48.280
Just now,

41:49.399 --> 41:51.439
you asked me if Shadow was the assassin.

41:51.720 --> 41:54.090
You should've kept
that question to yourself.

41:54.110 --> 41:55.700
You shouldn't have asked me that.

41:55.720 --> 41:56.800
You're right.

41:57.399 --> 41:59.320
If you were the mastermind,

41:59.600 --> 42:01.979
I would've been dead
the moment I asked you that question.

42:01.999 --> 42:03.280
If so, why did you ask me that question?

42:03.280 --> 42:04.600
I wouldn't have asked it

42:04.850 --> 42:05.819
if it was someone else.

42:05.839 --> 42:08.160
I wouldn't answered it
if it was someone else.

42:11.919 --> 42:14.019
Behind the assassination
in Hanging Temple...

42:14.039 --> 42:15.680
That's the truth.

42:20.399 --> 42:21.959
Rest well.

42:38.675 --> 42:42.240
[Guangxin Palace]

42:42.240 --> 42:45.600
What has Chen Pingping told you?

42:45.879 --> 42:46.959
Your Majesty,

42:47.600 --> 42:48.919
he told me about

42:49.120 --> 42:50.959
the backgrounds of the three assassins.

42:51.039 --> 42:52.119
Anything else?

42:52.760 --> 42:54.760
He also said that you might be the one

42:54.839 --> 42:56.760
who set the place on fire, Your Majesty.

43:16.260 --> 43:18.260
♪ The youth raises his head ♪

43:18.260 --> 43:22.340
♪ As he moves toward his moon ♪

43:23.860 --> 43:25.980
♪ People tease him for being delusional ♪

43:25.980 --> 43:29.760
♪ Wondering why he is so unconventional ♪

43:31.780 --> 43:35.340
♪ Wearing a white robe
when crossing a muddy pond ♪

43:35.340 --> 43:39.260
♪ How could it remain unstained? ♪

43:39.260 --> 43:41.180
♪ If silver tael has a value ♪

43:41.180 --> 43:44.780
♪ Who can truly be carefree? ♪

43:45.500 --> 43:48.180
♪ All of you are right ♪

43:48.200 --> 43:50.420
♪ He said: "Please" ♪

43:50.420 --> 43:53.480
♪ "Make way" ♪

43:53.500 --> 43:55.980
♪ "Let me drink until I drop" ♪

43:55.980 --> 43:57.900
♪ On the court ♪

43:57.900 --> 44:00.920
♪ I recite several verses ♪

44:00.940 --> 44:03.340
♪ Let me wear a white robe ♪

44:03.340 --> 44:05.420
♪ And cross the alley
filled with insanity ♪

44:05.420 --> 44:08.640
♪ To scoop up the moon's reflection
in the muddy pond ♪

44:08.660 --> 44:10.900
♪ Sirs, please forgive me ♪

44:10.900 --> 44:12.860
♪ Your words of advice ♪

44:12.860 --> 44:15.880
♪ I understand,
but I don't want to pretend ♪

44:15.900 --> 44:18.190
♪ People search for the golden land ♪

44:18.190 --> 44:20.260
♪ While I search for the moon ♪

44:20.260 --> 44:22.720
♪ Why should we travel together? ♪

44:22.740 --> 44:24.660
♪ Thank you ♪

44:24.660 --> 44:26.740
♪ Excuse me ♪

44:26.740 --> 44:28.420
♪ You are you ♪

44:28.420 --> 44:30.320
♪ I am me ♪

44:30.340 --> 44:32.260
♪ Thank you ♪

44:32.260 --> 44:34.220
♪ Excuse me ♪

44:34.220 --> 44:36.020
♪ You are you ♪

44:36.020 --> 44:39.480
♪ I am me ♪

44:51.550 --> 44:54.770
♪ Wearing a white robe
when crossing a muddy pond ♪

44:55.150 --> 44:58.620
♪ Remarkably worldly-wise
yet hopelessly romantic ♪

44:58.870 --> 45:02.010
♪ Know what you love ♪

45:02.200 --> 45:04.770
♪ Don't change ♪

45:06.660 --> 45:10.090
♪ If one has witnessed
both light and shadow ♪

45:10.160 --> 45:13.790
♪ Yet retains their innocence ♪

45:13.810 --> 45:16.840
♪ They shall be cloaked in moonlight ♪

45:16.900 --> 45:20.100
♪ As they journey through the night ♪
